| Kenyan AA           | 125   | 1.3    |

**Mathematical Model:**

**Objective:**
\[
\max \sum_{i \in \{1,\ldots,10\}} \sum_{j \in \{\text{all products}\}} v_j \cdot x_{ij}
\]

**Subject to:**

For each cabinet $i$ (CabinetID $= 1,\ldots,10$):
\[
\sum_{j} w_j \cdot x_{ij} \leq C_i
\]

For all $i, j$:
\[
x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}
\]

